    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inverse of R76 is derivative of: in DeSMòS, it relates a source expression to the expressions derived from it. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Inversa di R76 is derivative of: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione fonte alle espressioni che ne derivano. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
